cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "VEXAS/MAS multiomic study - analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a multiomic characterization of VEXAS-associated macrophage
  activation syndrome, including Crawford-Howell single-case inference for
  cytokine and flow-cytometry comparisons.
